# oracle: eFF H2 under fix nph/eff with the fix page's example targets x 1, y 2, z 3, yz 0.1, xz 0.2, xy 0.3 (period 0.5) and nreset 1000 on a triclinic box: the deviatoric barostat with the electron radial terms, 10 steps
# oracle-inputs: w63eff_h2.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           electron
newton          on
boundary        p p p
atom_style      electron
read_data       w63eff_h2.data
change_box      all triclinic
pair_style      eff/cut 6.447968 pressure/evirials
pair_coeff      * *
comm_modify     vel yes
thermo          2
velocity        all create 300.0 4928459 dist gaussian rot yes mom yes
timestep        0.0005
fix             1 all nph/eff x 1.0 1.0 0.5 y 2.0 2.0 0.5 z 3.0 3.0 0.5 yz 0.1 0.1 0.5 xz 0.2 0.2 0.5 xy 0.3 0.3 0.5 nreset 1000
thermo_style    custom step pe ke temp press vol lx ly lz xy xz yz f_1
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             10
